@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@memoId = 3f22df4f-b187-42dd-81f3-d9f2fa5ce001

### Admin get community memos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get hidden community memos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos?hidden=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get community memos by moderation status
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos?moderationStatus=allowed&sourceType=DIRECT&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get reported community memos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos?reported=true&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin search community memos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos?keyword=망고
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get community memo detail
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get community memo reports
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin get community memo reports by reason
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/reports?reason=inappropriate&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin hide community memo
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/hide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "reason": "신고 내용 확인 결과 부적절한 이미지로 판단했습니다."
}

### Admin restore community memo
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/restore
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "reason": "오신고로 확인되어 복구합니다."
}

### Admin community memo - invalid memo UUID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin community memo reports - invalid memo UUID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/not-a-uuid/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin community memo reports - invalid reason
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/reports?reason=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin community memo reports - invalid pagination
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/reports?page=-1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Admin community memo reports - unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/reports

### Admin hide community memo - missing reason
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/community/memos/{{memoId}}/hide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "reason": ""
}
